    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p>A small creature is placed in, on, or around the heart. It absorbs and separates toxins that make their way into the bloodstream, rendering them inert. A creature with a Poison Filter gains a +5 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus to their <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a> against <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Poisons\" title=\"Poisons\">Poisons</a>. </p>",
